{
  "slug": "holistics-development",
  "name": "Holistics Development",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills for exploring, analyzing, and developing analytics code in Holistics Development env.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `analyze-data` (Explain AQL queries and their results, and provide data insights), `build-custom-chart` (Create or refine a Holistics custom chart (CustomChartDef in library/custom_charts/) for a chart type the built-in viz can't…), `build-dashboard-theme` (Create, update, or apply a Holistics dashboard theme (library/themes/) from any input: a brand name, website, screenshot, brand…), `convert-agent-skill-to-holistics` (Convert an agent skill written for another runtime (Claude `SKILL.md`, OpenAI/Codex skill, raw system prompt) into a Holistics…), `create-holistics-skill` (Author a Holistics skill), `develop-amql` (Write and edit AML/AQL code for Holistics models, datasets, dashboards, and metrics), `search-docs` (Search Holistics documentation to answer questions about features, syntax, or concepts), `setup-amql-development` (Use this whenever working in a (Holistics) AMQL project (i.e), and 5 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install holistics-development@claude-community` from `holistics/skills` (`plugins/holistics-development`).",
